      "color": "#a55faa",
      "value": 1,
      "title": "\n            <body>\n            <h3> <a href='https://nicholascorniaorpheus.github.io/a_gothic_gamebook/scenes/Ancient_grave_-_AGG_2025'>Ancient grave</a></h3>\n            <p>Wandering through the graveyard, a lone sepulchre draws the attention of our character. A decayed statue depicting a knight in armour has suffered centuries of erosion; a shadow of its former glory. The epitaph on the tomb tells the tale of a nobleman of old, tragically departing from our world on the day of his marriage.Musical pieces: Auf einer Burg Op. 39 n. 7</p>\n            </body>\n            ",
