      "color": "#a55faa",
      "value": 1,
      "title": "\n            <body>\n            <h3> <a href='https://nicholascorniaorpheus.github.io/a_gothic_gamebook/scenes/Demonic_deception_-_AGG_2025'>Demonic deception</a></h3>\n            <p>The strange bird disappears from Sasha’s view. Suddenly, a hooded figure appears from the point at which the bird vanished. The wanderer is revealed as Ymir, a lady with pale skin and untamed scarlet curls. Musical pieces: Unbewegte laue Luft Op. 57 n.8</p>\n            </body>\n            ",
