    {
      "label": "Demons keep the lovers apart",
      "color": "#a55faa",
      "value": 1,
      "title": "\n            <body>\n            <h3> <a href='https://nicholascorniaorpheus.github.io/a_gothic_gamebook/scenes/Demons_keep_the_lovers_apart_-_AGG_2025'>Demons keep the lovers apart</a></h3>\n            <p>The charming figure of Ymir leads Sasha to a ruined castle in the woods. As the gates of the castle open, a beautiful, brightly-lit garden is revealed. Fair ladies and courtiers of a forgotten time entice Sasha to join them. Sasha forgets all of their worries and the memory of their beloved Rune is merely a distant echo. Musical pieces: Die Geister haben's vernommen, Der Tod und das Mädchen D.531</p>\n            </body>\n            ",
