      "label": "Despair and homesickness. Giving up their dreams",
      "color": "#a55faa",
      "value": 1,
      "title": "\n            <body>\n            <h3> <a href='https://nicholascorniaorpheus.github.io/a_gothic_gamebook/scenes/Despair_and_homesickness._Giving_up_their_dreams_-_AGG_2025'>Despair and homesickness. Giving up their dreams</a></h3>\n            <p>After the horrifying experiences of the last hours, our character has despaired completely. Returning to the awful circumstances at home seems a better  choice than remaining here. Musical pieces: In der Fremde Op. 39 n. 1, Ich stand in dunklen Traümen Op. 13 n.1</p>\n            </body>\n            ",
