    {
      "label": "Elf of the woods creates charming illusion",
      "color": "#a55faa",
      "value": 1,
      "title": "\n            <body>\n            <h3> <a href='https://nicholascorniaorpheus.github.io/a_gothic_gamebook/scenes/Elf_of_the_woods_creates_charming_illusion_-_AGG_2025'>Elf of the woods creates charming illusion</a></h3>\n            <p>Walking through the thick undergrowth, Sasha hears the sound of a small brook. While slaking their thirst, Sasha notices the ethereal sounds of an ancient song. The indistinguishable words of the song lead Sasha to a state of enchantment. While losing consciousness, a fairylike creature emerges from the water. Musical pieces: Bedeckt mich mit Blumen IHW 32 n. 36</p>\n            </body>\n            ",
