      "color": "#a55faa",
      "value": 1,
      "title": "\n            <body>\n            <h3> <a href='https://nicholascorniaorpheus.github.io/a_gothic_gamebook/scenes/Falling_asleep_-_AGG_2025'>Falling asleep</a></h3>\n            <p>The realm of consciousness is succeeded by the dimension of dreams. Exhausted, Sasha falls into deep sleep. Lying on a carpet of fallen leaves, Sasha is at the mercy of the elements and any hostile beings who may appear. Musical pieces: Feldeinsamkeit Op. 86 n. 2</p>\n            </body>\n            ",
