    {
      "label": "Falling unconscious from undead encounter",
      "color": "#a55faa",
      "value": 1,
      "title": "\n            <body>\n            <h3> <a href='https://nicholascorniaorpheus.github.io/a_gothic_gamebook/scenes/Falling_unconscious_from_undead_encounter_-_AGG_2025'>Falling unconscious from undead encounter</a></h3>\n            <p>The confrontation with the ancient spirit of the fallen knight tests Rune’s nerves and faith. Visions of their own sorrows and vicissitudes resonate with the knight’s tragic fate. They are joined by other spirits, who dance around them in mockery and slowly begin to drain their life-force. Musical pieces: Totengräbers Heimweh D. 842</p>\n            </body>\n            ",
