      "label": "Following path and getting lost",
      "color": "#a55faa",
      "value": 1,
      "title": "\n            <body>\n            <h3> <a href='https://nicholascorniaorpheus.github.io/a_gothic_gamebook/scenes/Following_path_and_getting_lost_-_AGG_2025'>Following path and getting lost</a></h3>\n            <p>Sasha follows the path through the gloomy forest. Every shadow or sound is turned into an ill omen of terror by the impenetrable darkness of the night. But love drives the steps of our character forward, surmounting their ancestral fear.Musical pieces: Zwielicht Op. 39 n.10</p>\n            </body>\n            ",
