      "label": "Happy ending",
      "color": "#c14834",
      "value": 10,
      "title": "\n            <body>\n            <h3> <a href='https://nicholascorniaorpheus.github.io/a_gothic_gamebook/scenes/Happy_ending_-_AGG_2025'>Happy ending</a></h3>\n            <p>Sasha and Rune are finally reunited. There are no words to describe their endless joy. A bright future awaits them, and if they haven’t died, they are still living happily together. “Und wenn sie nicht gestorben sind, dann leben sie noch heute”.Musical pieces: Hochzeitslied D. 463, Du bist mir lieb, Liebst du um schönheit GMW 43</p>\n            </body>\n            ",
