      "label": "Mistrust of animals",
      "color": "#a55faa",
      "value": 1,
      "title": "\n            <body>\n            <h3> <a href='https://nicholascorniaorpheus.github.io/a_gothic_gamebook/scenes/Mistrust_of_animals_-_AGG_2025'>Mistrust of animals</a></h3>\n            <p>Sasha suddenly wakes up, realising that exhaustion had led them to fall asleep in the middle of the forest. Dawn brings a feeling of unease to our character. Mistrusting and invisible eyes keep watch while Sasha prepares to depart. Musical pieces: Der Feind Op. 145</p>\n            </body>\n            ",
