    {
      "label": "Prayer of the Hermit",
      "color": "#a55faa",
      "value": 1,
      "title": "\n            <body>\n            <h3> <a href='https://nicholascorniaorpheus.github.io/a_gothic_gamebook/scenes/Prayer_of_the_Hermit_-_AGG_2025'>Prayer of the Hermit</a></h3>\n            <p>After having listened to Rune’s story, the hermit recites a prayer in a low and solemn tone. The words of the invocation reveal a glimpse of Vanadis’s past, echoing the same miseries of our character’s love story. Rune regains strength and faith. After some kind words of farewell, they resume their journey.Musical pieces: Gedichte der Königin Maria Stuart Op.135 n.5</p>\n            </body>\n            ",
