    {
      "label": "Seek shelter in abandoned monastery",
      "color": "#a55faa",
      "value": 1,
      "title": "\n            <body>\n            <h3> <a href='https://nicholascorniaorpheus.github.io/a_gothic_gamebook/scenes/Seek_shelter_in_abandoned_monastery_-_AGG_2025'>Seek shelter in abandoned monastery</a></h3>\n            <p>Rune manages to find refuge in an old monastery, by opening the rusty old gate of the building. Empty halls tell forgotten tales of countless generations of nuns and their seclusion. Rune falls asleep in an austere cell.Musical pieces: Die junge Nonne D.828</p>\n            </body>\n            ",
