    {
      "label": "Staying awake",
      "color": "#a55faa",
      "value": 1,
      "title": "\n            <body>\n            <h3> <a href='https://nicholascorniaorpheus.github.io/a_gothic_gamebook/scenes/Staying_awake_-_AGG_2025'>Staying awake</a></h3>\n            <p>Despite muddy boots and wet clothes, Sasha continues to strive against the stormy weather. Maintaining a steady pace, the trail gradually becomes clearer. In the distance, the old estate is visible. Sasha’s thoughts of their beloved are a guiding star leading them tirelessly onwards. Musical pieces: Die Mainacht Op. 43 n.2</p>\n            </body>\n            ",
