    {
      "label": "Taking a \"shortcut\"",
      "color": "#a55faa",
      "value": 1,
      "title": "\n            <body>\n            <h3> <a href='https://nicholascorniaorpheus.github.io/a_gothic_gamebook/scenes/Taking_a_\"shortcut\"_-_AGG_2025'>Taking a \"shortcut\"</a></h3>\n            <p>According to their grandfather, an abandoned game trail should still be traceable, potentially saving several hours of travel. In leaving the security of the main road in favour of the unknown, Sasha turns their back to their former life to pursue a nobler goal.Musical pieces: Wir wandelten Op.96 n. 2</p>\n            </body>\n            ",
