    {
      "label": "Telling own story with a song",
      "color": "#a55faa",
      "value": 1,
      "title": "\n            <body>\n            <h3> <a href='https://nicholascorniaorpheus.github.io/a_gothic_gamebook/scenes/Telling_own_story_with_a_song_-_AGG_2025'>Telling own story with a song</a></h3>\n            <p>The lonely figure, a Hermit by the name of Vanadis, is leading Rune to their abandoned chapel. Once arrived, the Hermit breaks their silence to offer Rune some rustic refreshment. Rune decides to repay the Hermit’s hospitality by telling their tale of thwarted love and great misfortune. Musical pieces: Wehmut Op. 39 no. 9</p>\n            </body>\n            ",
