    {
      "label": "Wandering through the ruins",
      "color": "#bfe0db",
      "value": 10,
      "title": "\n            <body>\n            <h3> <a href='https://nicholascorniaorpheus.github.io/a_gothic_gamebook/scenes/Wandering_through_the_ruins_-_AGG_2025'>Wandering through the ruins</a></h3>\n            <p>Rune arrives at an abandoned summer estate, a desolate castle once the splendor of a noble family. Rain has been falling incessantly, having helped Rune’s escape from their greedy tutor. While wandering through the ruins, Rune seeks a refuge for the night.Musical pieces: Wie rafft ich mich auf Op. 32 n.1</p>\n            </body>\n            ",
