    {
      "label": "Witch's love enchantment",
      "color": "#a55faa",
      "value": 1,
      "title": "\n            <body>\n            <h3> <a href='https://nicholascorniaorpheus.github.io/a_gothic_gamebook/scenes/Witch's_love_enchantment_-_AGG_2025'>Witch's love enchantment</a></h3>\n            <p>Ymir, exhausted by the futility of trying to persuade Sasha to forget their lover, becomes enraged. Ymir’s charming facade disintegrates, and they utter primordial and mysterious syllables - an ancient language lost to the memory of man. An ancestral enchantment is binding  Sasha’s soul to the power of Ymir. Musical pieces: In dunkler Nacht Op. 60 no. 1</p>\n            </body>\n            ",
