    {
      "label": "Witches' ritual",
      "color": "#a55faa",
      "value": 1,
      "title": "\n            <body>\n            <h3> <a href='https://nicholascorniaorpheus.github.io/a_gothic_gamebook/scenes/Witches'_ritual_-_AGG_2025'>Witches' ritual</a></h3>\n            <p>The strange and mesmerising litany leads Sasha to an ancient well surrounded by trees of great age. A group of hooded figures surround the mossy stones, drawing water from the well with a frayed rope. One figure turns towards Sasha, revealing pale skin, crimson hair, and a supernatural beauty. Ymir offers them a cup of the mystical liquid. Musical pieces: Hexenlied Op. 8 n.8</p>\n            </body>\n            ",
